# Ad-hoc probe/settle/receipt test fixtures from local dev runs.
# These contain wallet addresses, EIP-712 signatures, EIP-3009 nonces,
# and raw X-PAYMENT envelopes from past probe sessions. Not sensitive
# in the secret sense (the wallet address is public), but not useful
# in a public repo either — Supabase is the canonical source for
# real receipts and `scripts/mock-provider.ts` is the canonical fixture
# source for tests. Keep these local.
body*.json
settle*.json
receipt.json
receipt-tampered.json
rcpt_*.json

